Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.90,0:00:05.46,Main - Italics,Watabe,0,0,0,,{\i1}Personally...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.33,0:00:12.18,Main - Italics,Watabe,0,0,0,,{\i1}I liked Miyamura-kun's hair long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.66,0:00:14.56,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Miyamura!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.56,0:00:17.43,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,They're making a sequel to \Nthat horror movie you liked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.43,0:00:19.29,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,R-Really...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.02,0:00:25.76,Main - Italics,Watabe,0,0,0,,{\i1}He was one of the few kids in class \Nwho wore glasses like me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.76,0:00:28.25,Main - Italics,Watabe,0,0,0,,{\i1}and his long hair gave him \Nan air of mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.53,0:00:31.16,Main - Italics,Watabe,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.55,0:00:32.51,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Watabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.95,0:00:35.51,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,About that reference book I asked about...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.51,0:00:37.92,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Let's go see it when it hits the theater.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.92,0:00:41.52,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,What? Oh, um... sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.52,0:00:47.43,Main - Italics,Watabe,0,0,0,,{\i1}But this fun-loving\NMiyamura-kun is nice, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.37,0:00:43.52,Main - Top,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Watabe?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.77,0:00:50.84,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Hey, Watabe, why'd you just take a picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.84,0:00:52.75,Main,Watabe,0,0,0,,To memorialize Miyamura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.75,0:00:54.43,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Memorialize him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.81,0:02:32.00,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Watabe-kun, what're you reading?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.31,0:02:33.44,Main,Watabe,0,0,0,,Oh, Miyamura-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.44,0:02:35.55,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Is it a mystery novel?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.55,0:02:37.65,Main,Watabe,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.65,0:02:41.51,Main,Watabe,0,0,0,,It's got some horror elements, \Nbut if you can get past those...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.08,0:02:43.40,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.98,0:02:47.54,Main,Watabe,0,0,0,,You guys talk about horror \Nstuff sometimes, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.54,0:02:51.21,Main,Watabe,0,0,0,,I kind of like it, too. \NEspecially Japanese horror movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.21,0:02:54.27,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Hori-san who likes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.84,0:02:57.15,Main,Watabe,0,0,0,,You two would probably get along great.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.34,0:03:01.66,Main,Watabe,0,0,0,,Ah, I s-see...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.79,0:03:06.29,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Oh, b-but I also like it, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.29,0:03:09.91,Main,Watabe,0,0,0,,Really? So you're into it, too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.26,0:03:11.22,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.67,0:03:17.42,Main - Italics,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is this? Why is Watabe \Nwearing his heart on his sleeve like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.42,0:03:19.67,Main,Watabe,0,0,0,,I can't believe we like the same stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.67,0:03:22.21,Main,Watabe,0,0,0,,I can recommend a few more books!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.21,0:03:23.52,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Great...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.24,0:03:26.93,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Hello, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.93,0:03:29.16,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Miyamura-kun, listen to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.16,0:03:34.87,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,I made chawanmushi today! \NLet's all have some together!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.87,0:03:36.69,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Chawanmushi, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.69,0:03:38.72,Main,Sota,0,0,0,,Miyamura, listen to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.72,0:03:41.49,Main,Sota,0,0,0,,It has ginko nuts in it! I put them in!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.49,0:03:43.83,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Hey, nice job!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.83,0:03:45.45,Main - Italics,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}Like father, like son.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.95,0:03:49.83,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Oh, Hori-s—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.83,0:03:50.87,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.57,0:03:56.51,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Huh? Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.47,0:03:58.84,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.41,0:04:00.84,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,You stink of Watabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.97,0:04:04.77,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,It's normally Toru or Shindo-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.77,0:04:07.22,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,H-H-Hold it! You're choking me!\NI can't breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.22,0:04:08.85,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I usually smell one of them on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.31,0:04:12.29,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,How do you even know\Nwhat Watabe-kun smells like?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.29,0:04:15.10,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I took samples in case \Nsomething like this happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.50,0:04:17.16,Main - Italics,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}Something like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.16,0:04:20.23,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Can you really smell someone\Nafter I just talk to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.23,0:04:23.84,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Girls not register. Only guys register.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.84,0:04:25.68,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Why are you talking like a robot?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.39,0:04:28.05,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I don't smell anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.05,0:04:30.49,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,You don't need to be able to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.49,0:04:32.17,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I can, and that's what counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.49,0:04:32.50,Default,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\an9\shad0\fs20\c&H2F393F&\3c&HE9F0EE&\pos(506.819,53.986)}Great dog
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.50,0:04:34.22,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,No, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.22,0:04:38.67,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I don't think I'd know if you'd\Nbeen with someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.75,0:04:46.26,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,You mean if I hung out with a series \Nof guys every day like you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.26,0:04:50.51,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I don't like the way you phrased that,\Nbut basically, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.47,0:04:52.77,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I'd never do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.77,0:04:54.98,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,No, it's not about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.98,0:04:59.06,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,If you hung out with Ishikawa-kun\Nor the student council president,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.06,0:05:02.03,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be able to tell like you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.03,0:05:04.25,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Okay, then I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.58,0:05:06.66,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,If I cheat on you, I'll come out and say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.29,0:05:09.66,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Thanks, that's a big help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.66,0:05:10.78,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.66,0:05:12.91,Default,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\bord3\pos(118.4,41.6)\b1\shad0\c&H262F39&\3c&HE3EDEF&}Weird
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.41,0:05:12.91,Default,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\bord3\b1\shad0\c&H262F39&\3c&HE3EDEF&\pos(536.8,44)}Kinda weird
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.78,0:05:12.60,Main,Kyosuke,0,0,0,,Dinner's ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.25,0:05:18.17,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,And then she gets all angry...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.17,0:05:22.30,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,It's not like I was any good \Nat studying before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.30,0:05:25.81,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Of course, that means I need \Nto buckle down even harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.81,0:05:27.43,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Seems that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.43,0:05:30.11,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,You've got it pretty good, Ishikawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.11,0:05:33.68,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,If I so much as put some music on, \Nthe cord gets pulled out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.68,0:05:36.46,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Seriously? That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.46,0:05:38.61,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,I wish they wouldn't expect so much from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.61,0:05:40.98,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,We're doing the best we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.75,0:05:45.31,Main - Italics,_All,0,0,0,,{\i1}What was that about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.31,0:05:47.45,Main - Italics,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't tell...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.45,0:05:49.95,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Probably some Hori thing or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.95,0:05:51.70,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Yeah, that checks out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.06,0:05:54.58,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,They're both kinda weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.58,0:05:56.46,Default,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\shad0\fs20\c&H3D3A51&\3c&HE9F0EE&\an7\pos(87.6,51.2)}Through\Nand\Nthrough
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.89,0:06:00.58,Main,Shindo,0,0,0,,You so rarely invite me over. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.58,0:06:02.84,Main,Shindo,0,0,0,,Not that I don't love coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.84,0:06:05.60,Main,Shindo,0,0,0,,Oh, you don't need to return that controller.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.60,0:06:06.83,Main,Shindo,0,0,0,,I have more at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.83,0:06:10.72,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,That's not why I called you here. \NAnd I'm not giving back the controller.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.72,0:06:13.17,Main,Shindo,0,0,0,,What's up, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.93,0:06:18.18,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Close...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.18,0:06:19.73,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.58,0:06:22.70,Main,Shindo,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.70,0:06:24.42,Main,Shindo,0,0,0,,Are you gonna do something to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.42,0:06:26.44,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Yeah— Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.09,0:06:28.45,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,It'll only take a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.45,0:06:29.72,Main,Shindo,0,0,0,,Wh-What will?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.72,0:06:31.83,Main,Shindo,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do in that moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.83,0:06:33.20,Main,Shindo,0,0,0,,Take my life?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.58,0:06:36.03,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,You wouldn't understand, so I'm not saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.03,0:06:37.58,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Just hurry up and close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.58,0:06:41.50,Main,Shindo,0,0,0,,What?! What are you gonna \Ndo once I'm not looking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.50,0:06:44.59,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Would you keep it quiet? Just calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.28,0:06:53.57,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,There. Now I know what you smell like.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.57,0:06:55.97,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,You're the one most likely to make a move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.97,0:06:57.02,Main,Shindo,0,0,0,,On who?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.02,0:06:59.22,Main,Shindo,0,0,0,,H-Huh? What's this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.22,0:07:00.19,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.19,0:07:02.10,Default,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\shad0\fs20\c&H1B1E24&\3c&HE9F0EE&\an7\pos(111.6,65.6)}Miyamura in Hori mode
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.46,0:07:23.50,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Watabe, I honestly don't want to...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.22,0:07:27.13,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,But can I ask you something\Nthat no one else will?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.10,0:07:29.88,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Watabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.88,0:07:31.67,Main,Watabe,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.00,0:07:35.26,Main,Watabe,0,0,0,,Hang on. I just gotta move these \Nto my Miyamura-kun folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.87,0:07:38.39,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,I saw you take that picture \Nof Miyamura before...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.92,0:07:40.85,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Wait, your Miyamura folder?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.85,0:07:42.06,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,That's creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.06,0:07:46.22,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Watabe, do you... y'know...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.86,0:07:48.51,Main,ishikawa,0,0,0,,like Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.93,0:07:51.40,Main,Watabe,0,0,0,,It goes far beyond liking him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.34,0:07:54.28,Main,Watabe,0,0,0,,I can't explain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.28,0:07:55.65,Main,Watabe,0,0,0,,It's a great fascination.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.65,0:07:57.65,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.87,0:08:00.34,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,But Miyamura has a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.34,0:08:03.61,Main,Watabe,0,0,0,,Sorry, Ishikawa-kun. \NI don't know what you're getting at.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.61,0:08:06.54,Main,Watabe,0,0,0,,Miyamura-kun dating the\Nopposite sex is just adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.83,0:08:10.52,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,He has guy friends at other schools, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.52,0:08:11.91,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Like Shindo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.38,0:08:15.77,Main,Watabe,0,0,0,,So Miyamura-kun has guy friends \Nat other schools, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.87,0:08:18.84,Main - Italics,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,{\i1}So creepy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.84,0:08:22.06,Main - Italics,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,{\i1}No! I shouldn't think that about my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.06,0:08:23.44,Default,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\shad0\fs20\c&H1B1E24&\3c&HE9F0EE&\an9\pos(527.6,240.8)}Conflicted
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.05,0:08:27.52,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,So, Watabe, you're satisfied \Njust watching Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.85,0:08:29.75,Main,Watabe,0,0,0,,I'd love to touch him if I could!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.75,0:08:32.15,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Sorry, that isn't what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.53,0:08:34.86,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Do you think you want to talk to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.86,0:08:37.37,Main,Watabe,0,0,0,,Don't worry about that! I recorded him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.37,0:08:39.43,Main - Italics,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey, Watabe-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.43,0:08:41.93,Main - Italics,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm getting more worried...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.32,0:08:43.41,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.86,0:08:45.21,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Come play with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.21,0:08:48.42,Default,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\shad0\fs20\c&H1B1E24&\3c&HE9F0EE&\an9\pos(538.8,155.2)}Watabe vision
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.42,0:08:56.12,Main,Watabe,0,0,0,,Ishikawa-kun, even if a two-kilometer asteroid\Nfell on me right now, I would die happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.12,0:08:57.32,Main,Watabe,0,0,0,,He's shining so brightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.32,0:09:00.81,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Are you sure? An asteroid that \Nsize would kill Miyamura, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.25,0:09:04.57,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,You stink!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.57,0:09:05.86,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I can smell him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.86,0:09:07.81,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,It's Watabe again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.56,0:09:11.14,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,His scent is even stronger today!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.14,0:09:12.96,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,He's marking you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.96,0:09:14.10,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,You're ripping it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.13,0:09:19.14,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I don't really understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.14,0:09:21.57,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,but you're saying \NWatabe-kun got close to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.57,0:09:26.58,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,You smell of Shindo-kun and Tanihara too,\N but Watabe's scent is the strongest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.26,0:09:34.40,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,After all, Watabe has a stronger interest \Nin you than any of the other guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.40,0:09:37.09,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,How does his scent tell you that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.79,0:09:41.99,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I didn't even touch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.99,0:09:44.83,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if you touched him or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.30,0:10:02.35,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I know what {\i1}you{\i0} smell like, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.35,0:10:06.14,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I can't really tell with \NYoshikawa-san or Ayasaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.67,0:10:11.93,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I thought you'd finally do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.93,0:10:12.84,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.84,0:10:14.50,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,You turned around so suddenly...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.88,0:10:17.76,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I thought you were finally going\N to be rough with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.76,0:10:19.94,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Stop getting my hopes up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.94,0:10:23.17,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,W-Was what I did so bad \Nthat it made you cry?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.17,0:10:23.80,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.80,0:10:24.89,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.89,0:10:26.86,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Miyamura, you dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.18,0:10:31.02,Default,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1270,530)\fnArial\b1\bord0\an8\fs16\shad1\c&H7149D7&\3c&H89929F&\4c&H35546C&\pos(126.545,124.024)}Jealousy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.31,0:10:31.02,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,No more deodorizer, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.06,0:10:39.48,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Were you in an accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.48,0:10:41.58,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Nope, a man-made disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.58,0:10:42.53,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Hori, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.90,0:10:45.10,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Why? Did you have another fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.10,0:10:45.87,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.87,0:10:48.41,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,She really got you good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.78,0:10:52.42,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I'm not apologizing this time, \Nno matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.09,0:10:55.42,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.42,0:10:57.62,Main,Female Student A,0,0,0,,Hori-san, what happened to your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.62,0:10:59.18,Main,Female Student B,0,0,0,,That must hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.18,0:11:01.17,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Dude, did you hit her back?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.17,0:11:02.43,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.74,0:11:07.31,Flashback,Hori,0,0,0,,Miyamura, you dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.10,0:11:11.06,Flashback,Hori,0,0,0,,What is it? If you wanna \Nsay something, out with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.52,0:11:13.23,Flashback,Miyamura,0,0,0,,No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.23,0:11:16.67,Flashback,Miyamura,0,0,0,,You're talking dumb stuff, \Nso I'm going home, dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.67,0:11:18.82,Flashback,Hori,0,0,0,,Hey, who are you calling a dummy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.82,0:11:21.08,Flashback,Hori,0,0,0,,You really piss me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.83,0:11:27.93,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,She got so worked up she \Nsmacked right into the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.20,0:11:31.85,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,So, what were you fighting about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.20,0:11:34.33,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I forgot, just like always.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.25,0:11:38.96,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,This time, I won't budge \Nuntil Hori-san apologizes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.35,0:11:40.91,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,How manly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.91,0:11:42.40,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Yeah, good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.72,0:11:45.72,Default,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fay-.5\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs18\shad0\c&H5B5A64&\3c&HC4C1C8&\pos(316.244,69.377)\frx0\fry336}Student Council
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.57,0:11:45.72,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I can't believe him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.13,0:11:48.72,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,He wasn't even the least bit bothered!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.12,0:11:51.58,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Stupid Miyamura!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.06,0:11:53.85,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,Th-There, there...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.85,0:11:58.86,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Still, it's not about another girl. \NMaybe it's not that big a deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.87,0:12:01.81,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Guys are just as dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.81,0:12:03.31,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,You okay, Kyon-Kyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.31,0:12:04.74,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Did you hit your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.74,0:12:06.78,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Are you listening, Sengoku?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.33,0:12:11.07,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Why not just apologize to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.07,0:12:12.37,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Why should I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.37,0:12:15.12,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Why should you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.12,0:12:18.13,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,What will you do if Miyamura-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.13,0:12:22.06,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,stops caring about you, Kyo-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.63,0:12:28.68,Main,Sakura,0,0,0,,This could mean losing someone\Nwho's always been there for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.68,0:12:31.34,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,{\i1}When Sengoku says it, it pisses me off,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.34,0:12:33.89,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,{\i1}but when Kono-san says it, \Nit brings me to my senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.46,0:12:36.51,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I... I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.51,0:12:37.65,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.65,0:12:41.03,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,But I'm still angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.03,0:12:42.75,Main - Italics,_Both,0,0,0,,This is gonna take a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.54,0:12:47.41,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Each group has to submit their feedback.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.41,0:12:49.58,Default,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(890,1)\fnComic Sans MS\bord3\an8\b1\shad0\c&H2C3122&\3c&HE6E0E1&}Ignooore
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.90,0:12:52.59,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,I'm gonna put this together. \NThat okay with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.59,0:12:53.75,Main,_Both,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.04,0:12:58.79,Default,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs36\fnComic Sans MS\bord4\an8\b1\shad0\c&H292730&\3c&HD5D1D8&\pos(402.4,19.2)}RUMBLE
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.99,0:12:58.41,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Who cares if you answered at the same time?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.61,0:13:03.33,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Damn, you guys are tiring {\i1}me{\i0} out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.33,0:13:05.32,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Sorry to involve you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.63,0:13:08.02,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Honestly, I'm tired, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.02,0:13:11.63,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Why am I so angry again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.63,0:13:15.44,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Come on. At least remember \Nthe reason you were fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.44,0:13:17.90,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,You guys need to make up quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.90,0:13:19.85,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.97,0:13:22.36,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Hey, a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.36,0:13:24.07,Default,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,1)\fnArial\shad0\bord0\fs14\c&H262B23&\an1\frz344.6\pos(360.8,124)}Hori-san
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.36,0:13:24.07,Default,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,1)\fnArial\shad0\bord0\fs18\c&H262B23&\an7\pos(236.8,199.2)\frz343.9}My period's late\NDummy
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.19,0:13:28.59,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Ready to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.08,0:13:31.45,Default,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,1)\fnArial\shad0\bord0\fs14\c&H262B23&\an1\frz344.6\pos(360.8,124)}Hori-san
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.08,0:13:31.45,Default,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,1)\fnArial\shad0\bord0\fs18\c&H262B23&\an7\frz343.9\pos(252.8,169.6)}Just kidding, dummy
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.07,0:13:35.51,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Yoshikawa, I need some tissues.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.51,0:13:38.08,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Ew, Toru, you smell like apples.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.25,0:13:42.90,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,{\i1}What am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.97,0:13:47.28,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,{\i1}How stupid can I be?\NI just need to say I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.67,0:13:49.37,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.57,0:13:55.63,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Miyamura, c'mere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.63,0:13:56.89,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Have you seen Hori?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.82,0:14:01.25,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,She wasn't in class.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.17,0:14:04.04,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,And she wasn't in the clinic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.04,0:14:06.76,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Or the changing room. I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.76,0:14:09.06,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,The changing room? Did you go in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.06,0:14:11.10,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Well, that aside...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.10,0:14:12.49,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Did you go in?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.49,0:14:16.77,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,She left her bag behind, \Nand it's cold outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.77,0:14:18.00,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.52,0:14:20.50,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Huh? Outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.86,0:14:34.31,Main - Italics,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}There she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.58,0:14:37.68,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.52,0:14:43.75,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.01,0:14:49.65,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,You don't care about me anymore, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.65,0:14:50.73,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.07,0:14:53.91,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,You might not be with me someday, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.91,0:14:55.21,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.08,0:14:58.54,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,You hate me, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.18,0:15:00.46,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Why would I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.79,0:15:04.43,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,B-Because I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.78,0:15:09.12,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,What? Are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.59,0:15:12.98,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Come on. There's nothing to cry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.98,0:15:19.19,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,But... But... I always...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.19,0:15:23.88,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,get angry and treat you unfairly...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.47,0:15:25.86,Main - Italics,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}So she realizes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.36,0:15:29.27,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Let me see your face, Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.36,0:15:32.46,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.82,0:15:34.82,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.37,0:15:38.40,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Wow, Hori-san's in tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.83,0:15:42.57,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I guess even monsters can cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.57,0:15:45.72,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Your nose and ears are red and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.49,0:15:49.63,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,She's crying, crying, crying up a river.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.25,0:15:52.23,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,How embarrassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.57,0:15:55.39,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.39,0:15:58.52,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,H-How can you be so nice?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.52,0:16:02.63,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,You make me worry what would \Nhappen if you started hating me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.62,0:16:07.27,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Wh-What? That's what you were worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.68,0:16:13.28,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Hori-san, you always call me a dummy, \Nbut you're just as much of a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.28,0:16:17.78,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I know that! You really are a dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.78,0:16:19.79,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Oh, so you knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.34,0:16:26.79,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Also, I like you a lot more\Nthan you seem to realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.72,0:16:29.96,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,It'd be really hard to hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.80,0:16:33.69,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,You always say stuff like that, dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.69,0:16:35.29,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Dummymura!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.29,0:16:37.55,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,It's true, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.58,0:16:41.87,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Okay then, I'm sorry I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.27,0:16:49.69,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Damn, I apologized even though\N it wasn't my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.69,0:16:53.70,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,That's right! You didn't do anything wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.70,0:16:56.17,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,It's always my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.17,0:16:57.24,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.24,0:16:58.56,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.93,0:17:01.32,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,I dunno what they're talking about,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.32,0:17:04.78,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,but Hori kicked Miyamura\Nin the gut, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.78,0:17:05.86,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.52,0:17:08.31,Main - Italics,_Both,0,0,0,,Scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.31,0:17:11.71,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.71,0:17:14.63,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Hey! Morning, Miya...mura...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.66,0:17:19.35,Main - Italics,_Both,0,0,0,,{\i1}A hoodie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.70,0:17:21.20,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,What's up with that, Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.20,0:17:23.77,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,It doesn't really suit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.77,0:17:25.59,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,That looks like a nice, warm hoodie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.35,0:17:28.98,Default,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\shad0\fs20\c&H1D1F1E&\3c&HE9F0EE&\an1\pos(29.2,260)}Honest friends
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.59,0:17:27.08,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,It doesn't really suit you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.08,0:17:28.55,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Thanks for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.98,0:17:30.72,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I've never seen you in one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.37,0:17:34.93,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Erm, all my clothes are in the wash.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.93,0:17:35.74,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.65,0:17:38.87,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,It's nice to change things up a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.73,0:17:40.43,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,M...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.87,0:17:42.51,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Maybe you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.51,0:17:43.22,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.66,0:17:44.95,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.95,0:17:46.87,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Hey, someone let me borrow \Ntheir modern Japanese book!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.24,0:17:49.96,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Whoa, what's this, Miyamura? \NWe're both wearing hoodies!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.96,0:17:51.63,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Are you copying my style?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.63,0:17:52.45,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,No, he's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.45,0:17:53.49,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,He's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.49,0:17:54.88,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,But we're still dressed the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.88,0:17:57.41,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,It's cold, so I want to \Ntell people about hoodies,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.41,0:18:00.94,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,but still no one wears them, \Nand I feel so defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.94,0:18:03.89,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Yeah, probably because \Nthey're against the dress code.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.32,0:18:08.43,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,But you've got too many layers on. \NYou need to show it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.43,0:18:09.52,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.52,0:18:13.26,Main - Italics,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's violating the dress code,\Nbut you want him to show it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.39,0:18:15.53,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.53,0:18:18.28,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Put those sunglasses back \Nin the student council room!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.40,0:18:18.28,Default,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\fs16\bord3\shad0\c&H1A1C1E&\3c&HE6E7F8&\pos(135.2,224)}From that time
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.28,0:18:20.62,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Miyamura, hold your fingers like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.62,0:18:21.59,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.59,0:18:22.81,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.81,0:18:23.69,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.69,0:18:26.62,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Take this textbook and \Nget back to your class!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.16,0:18:28.44,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Tch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.44,0:18:31.70,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Why in the world is Shu so big on hoodies?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.70,0:18:34.92,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Maybe they're like his favorite equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.38,0:18:41.75,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I'd have to be more like Iura before I went \Naround flaunting something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.30,0:18:46.64,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Don't you dare try to be like Iura.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.64,0:18:49.17,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,In fact, be like anyone {\i1}except{\i0} him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.17,0:18:50.44,Main - Italics,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}Iura-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.31,0:18:54.33,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Ah, it's true! That's against the dress code!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.33,0:18:56.07,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Oh, good morning, President.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.07,0:18:56.94,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.61,0:19:00.00,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I just ran into Iura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.00,0:19:02.75,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,He said you'd come around on "his style."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.75,0:19:05.54,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I'm not. This is just for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.54,0:19:09.21,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Iura was wearing a hoodie, too.\NDid you scold him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.21,0:19:10.94,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.94,0:19:13.46,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,He's a lost cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.46,0:19:15.59,Default,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimes New Roman\fs48\b1\shad0\bord4\c&H1A1C1E&\3c&HDADCE4&}Resigned
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.19,0:19:15.59,Main - Italics,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}Iura-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.53,0:19:18.09,Main,Male Student,0,0,0,,Let's get some lunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.40,0:19:21.67,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Hey, they've got a new flavor of hot tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.67,0:19:22.67,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Did you see it this morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.67,0:19:24.30,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Really? What kind?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.30,0:19:26.10,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,One you'll like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.10,0:19:28.22,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.22,0:19:29.70,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Wait, Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.75,0:19:32.02,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Your hood needs fixing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.02,0:19:33.35,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.97,0:19:35.10,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.10,0:19:38.23,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,You need to straighten \N it out after you mess with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.44,0:19:44.33,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Wh-What was that for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.33,0:19:46.15,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Miyamura, that hoodie...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.15,0:19:46.99,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Let's get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.00,0:19:51.04,Main - Italics,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't fool Hori-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.25,0:19:54.00,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.00,0:19:55.44,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,You wearin' a hoodie tomorrow, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.44,0:19:58.22,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,No, I'll just wear my cardigan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.13,0:19:59.63,Main - Top,Hori,0,0,0,,Stare...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.51,0:20:07.68,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Stare...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.16,0:20:11.49,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Miyamura, are you coming over today?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.49,0:20:13.59,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,No, I need to get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.13,0:20:17.85,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Did something happen between them again?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.85,0:20:19.65,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.05,0:20:24.41,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Good morning, Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.41,0:20:25.72,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.72,0:20:27.22,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,It's pretty warm today, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.22,0:20:29.29,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Yeah, the sun's shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.08,0:20:31.97,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Aren't you cold without a scarf, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.97,0:20:34.29,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Stare...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.54,0:20:36.57,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Hori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.93,0:20:40.07,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.18,0:20:45.18,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.84,0:20:51.68,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Hori-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.76,0:20:57.44,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,It smells like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.44,0:21:00.32,Default,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\b1\an8\frz18.86\shad0\bord3\c&H3F3959&\3c&HE5EBE7&\pos(63.2,80.8)}Here
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.44,0:21:00.32,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Huh? O-Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.32,0:21:02.78,Main - Italics,Miyamura,0,0,0,,{\i1}I didn't realize what she was up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.78,0:21:05.91,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is your scent.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.91,0:21:08.45,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Your hoodie smelled like someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.71,0:21:12.58,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Stare...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.88,0:21:12.58,Main - Top,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.58,0:21:14.44,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,It was Shindo's.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.44,0:21:17.27,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,He left it at my place \Nthe last time he stayed over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.27,0:21:18.84,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,That's what I figured.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.84,0:21:21.96,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,How could you tell? I washed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.96,0:21:24.03,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,It was obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.34,0:21:27.09,Main - Italics,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Not to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.45,0:21:31.86,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Besides, your scent is my favorite!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.25,0:21:36.99,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Make sure you give Shindo-kun's hoodie back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.26,0:21:39.61,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Your hands are cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.81,0:21:47.96,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.96,0:21:50.33,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, um, okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.74,0:21:52.83,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just gonna leave it at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.21,0:21:59.13,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Oh, good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.13,0:22:00.96,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,G-Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.96,0:22:02.62,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.62,0:22:04.00,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Y'know...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.74,0:22:06.53,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,It's a warm day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.47,0:23:40.02,Default,_Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(487,1)\c&HC2A774&\3c&HF4F9ED&\shad0\an7\fs16\pos(413.242,316.744)}Next time\Npage.11 Chocolate
